@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR7,ArmL6
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:呜呜，呜呜呜……|#0104Adv03_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:湖边只剩亚里沙一个人蹲在地上，<br>不断发出无力的呻吟。|#0104Adv03_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:差点就把艾玛杀了。<br>这一事实将亚里沙逼入了穷途末路之中。|#0104Adv03_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那阵绝望之感，甚至把她逼得想要把自己烧成灰烬。|#0104Adv03_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但亚里沙燃起的那团神奇的火焰却不会如她所愿，<br>点燃她的身体。|#0104Adv03_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR7,ArmL6

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么，为什么烧不着我自己！|#0104Adv03_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; 地面を殴る音・強
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_65 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:她一拳一拳地打在地上，<br>除了折磨自己以外，她无能为力。|#0104Adv03_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她左手握拳，带着憎恶用尽全身力气敲打在地上。<br>手上的皮肤擦破，渗出了鲜红的血液。|#0104Adv03_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:点滴落在地面上的血化作蝴蝶的绘画，<br>又渐渐跟飘落的雪花重叠混合。|#0104Adv03_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,ArmR4,ArmL6

[PrintTextModified Text:可恶，可恶，可恶！！|#0104Adv03_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:——亚里沙小姐。|#0104Adv03_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，亚里沙的背后传来一声呼唤。<br>她回过神来，转头往回看。|#0104Adv03_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:冰上……|#0104Adv03_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露站在亚里沙的身后。<br>她看着很难受，眼泪一直在眼眶里打转。|#0104Adv03_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙小姐，请你不要再伤害自己……<br>我已经，看不下去了……！|#0104Adv03_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry,ArmR1,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:别过来！不要管我！|#0104Adv03_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙压抑不住心里的冲动，<br>冲着梅露露放出了一团火焰。|#0104Adv03_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 放たれた炎の音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_46 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:火焰的势头以及蕴含的热量，跟之前朝着艾玛<br>放出的火团完全天差地别。|#0104Adv03_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙的魔女化程度已经加深，她的魔法变得十分强大。<br>火焰把梅露露整个人都包裹了起来。|#0104Adv03_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊啊啊啊！！|#0104Adv03_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露随即倒地。|#0104Adv03_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看着在熊熊火焰下燃烧的梅露露，<br>亚里沙恢复了一点神志。|#0104Adv03_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Fearful1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊、啊，冰上，怎么会这样……|#0104Adv03_Alisa006| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:眨眼间，梅露露似乎已被烧成灰烬。望见此情此景的亚里沙，<br>在绝望的蒙蔽下，只觉得眼前一片漆黑。|#0104Adv03_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是我，杀的……？<br>变成魔女的我……杀人了，啊啊啊啊啊！！|#0104Adv03_Alisa007| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙也跪在了地上。|#0104Adv03_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:过了一会，火焰熄灭了。<br>这时地上应该躺着梅露露被烧焦的尸体才对。|#0104Adv03_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但梅露露却爬了起来——她还活着。<br>就连一点烧伤的痕迹都没有。|#0104Adv03_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:冰上……？|#0104Adv03_Alisa008| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:我没事。我用治愈魔法勉强挺过来了……<br>亚里沙小姐没有杀死任何人。|#0104Adv03_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:是、是吗，原来是治愈魔法……太好了……<br>冰上，对不起。|#0104Adv03_Alisa009| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但对我来说，是谁都没关系。<br>只要有人靠近我，我肯定会想杀人……|#0104Adv03_Alisa010| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:请你冲着我来。|#0104Adv03_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……？|#0104Adv03_Alisa011| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:当你压抑不住这股冲动时，就请冲着我来。<br>我会用魔法挺过去的……|#0104Adv03_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙小姐这么痛苦的模样，我实在看不下去……|#0104Adv03_Meruru007| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露站起身来，<br>向着亚里沙走去。|#0104Adv03_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然亚里沙小姐一直表现得很坚强，<br>但其实是个温柔善良的人……|#0104Adv03_Meruru008| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你一直害怕伤害到其他人，<br>害怕得不得了。|#0104Adv03_Meruru009| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:我也跟你一样。<br>其实我们都一样。|#0104Adv03_Meruru010| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:冰上……|#0104Adv03_Alisa012| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

