[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露拿起亚里沙的手<br>按在自己的脸颊上。|#0104Adv03_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后露出一个欲哭还笑的表情。|#0104Adv03_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我也胆小得很，<br>总是害怕自己会伤害到其他人……|#0104Adv03_Meruru011| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对不起，我这个胆小鬼能做的，只有这么一点小事。|#0104Adv03_Meruru012| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……怎么还道起歉来了呢。<br>一直以来你不都会为了其他人拼尽全力嘛。|#0104Adv03_Alisa013| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哎，你啊，总是在道歉呢。|#0104Adv03_Alisa014| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙的手捧着梅露露的脸，<br>但那双手已然异于常人。|#0104Adv03_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的外表也同样地，<br>越来越像残骸了。|#0104Adv03_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请你不要再伤害自己……<br>大家都很需要亚里沙小姐。|#0104Adv03_Meruru013| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请不要丢下我们……请你继续留在我们的身边。|#0104Adv03_Meruru014| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露的语气是那么的温柔，<br>让亚里沙感到一阵不可言喻的安宁。|#0104Adv03_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……|#0104Adv03_Alisa015| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙低头看了看自己那双已经化为异形的双手，<br>发现上面的伤已经愈合。|#0104Adv03_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:明明刚才还杀意顿起攻击了梅露露，<br>但现在亚里沙已经冷静下来。|#0104Adv03_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:你的治疗魔法，<br>能够抑制魔女化吗？|#0104Adv03_Alisa016| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露吃了一惊，向着亚里沙摆了摆手。|#0104Adv03_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Surprised

[PrintTextModified Text:不、不行，我想应该抑制不了……|#0104Adv03_Meruru015| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是因为你有稍微冷静下来了的关系吧。|#0104Adv03_Meruru016| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:……好像是这样。|#0104Adv03_Alisa017| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:抬头窥探夜色，<br>能看到雪还在下——<br>像是想要令失去冷静的身体得到冷却一般。|#0104Adv03_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对于受到灼热诅咒的亚里沙来说，<br>这阵冰冷甚至算得上是一种救赎。|#0104Adv03_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙深深吐了一口气。<br>她的内心已经基本上平静下来了。|#0104Adv03_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢你，冰上。<br>但我不会再伤害你了。|#0104Adv03_Alisa018| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不会变成魔女。|#0104Adv03_Alisa019| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Surprised

[PrintTextModified Text:真、真的吗……？|#0104Adv03_Meruru017| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。我不想杀人，也不想伤害任何人。<br>我绝对不会变成魔女。我跟你约好了。|#0104Adv03_Alisa020| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙小姐……太好了。|#0104Adv03_Meruru018| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Smile1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:不……我才应该，跟你说谢谢。|#0104Adv03_Alisa021| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:总感觉……事情都想明白了。<br>我来保护你们。|#0104Adv03_Alisa022| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……我绝对，会保护好你们。|#0104Adv03_Alisa023| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:……嗯！|#0104Adv03_Meruru019| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙终于再次展露笑容。<br>梅露露也跟着笑了起来。|#0104Adv03_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

